{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3030d3381d49c5ccf9177ac04b7480e58cca210438607f8e1bf1e9d0c3f283c1", "ja": "（39プロジェクトのアイドルをスカウトしに、文化祭\nに力を入れてると噂の学校へ来たのはいいけど……）", "zh": "（为了寻找适合39PROJECT的偶像，\n我来到一所据说文化祭办得十分用心的学校，只是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0f7f4d259face4225919252ce4dfc67045e5a378b621e6317e52cd66abbddbf7", "ja": "まいったな。体育館へ向かってたはずなのに……。\n早くしないと有志バンドのライブが始まってしまう。", "zh": "伤脑筋，我要去体育馆啊……\n再不快一点，学生乐团的表演就要开始了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "8b0911f37e2bdcd6bfa26c2ae42ef8d08bed57bd09084012100531f2ff46d0eb", "ja": "あの。こんなところで、どうかしたのでしょうか？\nこの付近には、模擬店などはありませんが。", "zh": "不好意思，请问你在这里做什么呢？\n这附近应该没有摊位才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_1003_p", "source_sha256": "fa894d5ea1b371846dbad5e6030c63cefc6116a6d3616ab3668f1f4714c59423", "ja": "ん？　君は……\nここの学校の生徒さんかな？", "zh": "嗯？你是……\n这所学校的学生吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "775fb4ddb40845d8f3774782e05cee5fa7862b128f7adcc3826189c959906cb7", "ja": "はい。生徒会の、真壁瑞希といいます。来場した方が\n迷子にならないように、校内の見回りをしていました。", "zh": "是的。我是学生会成员，真壁瑞希。\n我在校园中巡逻，以防莅临的嘉宾迷路。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "b878afd39f89ada05af71b17311fb9cab89848193b0b6fb705f37f5c7db956dc", "ja": "目的地があるようでしたら、案内することができます。\nただし、場所は校内に限りますが。", "zh": "如果你有想去的地方，我可以为你带路。\n只是，那些地方必须在学校里面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1c6a098d3ee9aa61018b8f90eb970fb0b149b82d8e1824b0207e1f4000c244ed", "ja": "ああ、それはご丁寧にありがとう。\nえっと……。", "zh": "好，谢谢你这么仔细说明。\n我想要去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_1007_p", "source_sha256": "21584a01d5ef36c2b90f6e8e0a2f6a15626a90bd0f88f18de623f0eb6c232fab", "ja": "（なんだろう。自然と目が引きつけられる子だな。\n声も可愛らしいし、これは……）", "zh": "（好奇怪，这女孩会让人不由自主地看着她。\n声音也很可爱，这……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "fb6842314a935dcbf32cf636232aef97f8a92235f78a72e0f94ca15461125caf", "ja": "あの……なんでしょうか？\n私の顔に、何かついていますか？", "zh": "请问……有什么事吗？\n我的脸上有东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "e6ea73ccf53b93a1d61eddfaf75ed9ca9cd9a26ab3902ff78d48a223e02d14fc", "ja": "はっ。もしや来場したお客様ではなく、\n不審な方だったのでしょうか。", "zh": "啊！莫非你不是嘉宾，\n而是可疑人士吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "8e9f0b37953c2a70cd8eb94b1dcfe2d9a195c5249dbc7ac8788466dc10ee1359", "ja": "これは事案の予感。……いけない。\nピンチだぞ、瑞希。メーデー、メーデー。", "zh": "感觉要发生案件了……糟糕。\n大危机啊，瑞希。求救、求救。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_1011_p", "source_sha256": "18535e1002865d04116635744d657a46e86809eda7a3f13c5a72e07946d61050", "ja": "ち、違うんだ…！\n俺は、実はこういうもので……。", "zh": "你、你误会了……！\n其实，我是做这行的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_1012", "source_sha256": "b17ca4d3bdeeeaffbc5d36b1c3d7e7fd69390b707c28e7d3c021eca0bf941d3d", "ja": "名刺を渡す", "zh": "递出名片", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_2000_044miz", "source_sha256": "192d0621a5535fa621f98a10759b9851c8c9a9e7f632f9af8d6be05b52ccca52", "ja": "この名刺……なるほど。\nアイドルのプロデューサーさんでしたか。", "zh": "这张名片是……我明白了。\n原来你是偶像的制作人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_2001_044miz", "source_sha256": "9bbe8fd86b730e732e9d45c4120c557b6b55fa435cef111a7ec2a71632ae9383", "ja": "TVで見るアイドルは、とても可愛いです。\nそれに、キラキラしていて……ちょっと、憧れます。", "zh": "我在电视上看过偶像，她们都非常可爱。\n而且闪亮动人……我有一点点向往。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_2002_p", "source_sha256": "646d1b8f551b28d7098ca996b5e9d2dcc46549f52416bb458f1c890293c06697", "ja": "本当に？　だったら、\n君がそのアイドルになってみないか？", "zh": "真的吗？既然如此，\n你要不要也来当偶像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_2004_044miz", "source_sha256": "42b48a4046c21b1faf3ee9605275512cfe16a3cf0aa11b3eeed9a6443210e4f6", "ja": "ぷはっ。驚きのあまり、呼吸するのを忘れていました。\n……苦しかったぞ。", "zh": "噗哈。我太过震惊，都忘记要呼吸了。\n……好难受啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_2005_044miz", "source_sha256": "28cde21f05354e99a8f9d91b40050fd26a669ee64d911841022d7baca26e9d37", "ja": "突然のことなので、混乱しています。\nアイドル。……私でも、なれるのでしょうか。", "zh": "突然被这样问，我陷入混乱了。\n偶像……我也能当吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_2006_p", "source_sha256": "eb9c83638265ea0fb9b70c98ee45c578a644f332985ee2249d67961f2c5fbbca", "ja": "混乱するのは当然だと思う。\nだから、今すぐにとは言わないけど……。", "zh": "我觉得你会混乱也是正常的。\n所以，我不会要你现在就答复……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_2007_p", "source_sha256": "3e1c440a6d42cbb590f3efb081870fc2746e3fc6a050a9401a0a6f49ceb97fd9", "ja": "でも君ならきっと、TVの中にいるみたいな、\nキラキラしたアイドルになれる！　俺が約束するよ。", "zh": "不过你一定能像电视上的那些人一样，\n成为闪耀动人的偶像！我向你保证。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_2008_044miz", "source_sha256": "f540341c4f1fac20e5dbed2ac82e19f2f20acbb1c336c433b62d540fc1f5310f", "ja": "そうですか。ありがとうございます。\n私が、アイドル。……なんだか、信じられないな。", "zh": "是这样吗？谢谢你的夸奖。\n我要成为偶像……感觉好难以置信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_2009_044miz", "source_sha256": "91144c4158b002d727a29ab1e1a4b8cd3561611b09a48f03e9d48a232f00e392", "ja": "スカウト、ありがとうございます。\n家に帰って、じっくり考えてみたいと思います。", "zh": "谢谢你的邀请。\n我回家后会好好考虑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_2010_p", "source_sha256": "63efba81b949939f59c0087d8881ca58d903acaf1820b3d6958712161e71cfcc", "ja": "ああ。もしアイドルになってもいいと思ったら、\nぜひ連絡してほしい。待ってるよ！", "zh": "好。如果你愿意来当偶像，\n希望务必要和我连络。我会等你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_2011_044miz", "source_sha256": "83356588561a699085b4c8be04dd97a8437fd897a14b9ffea763d9b048e786e7", "ja": "はい、わかりました。", "zh": "好的，我明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_2012_null", "source_sha256": "e904e235785d6796656f1fa81213ed705024cdc1145febefed8118f8da8dcbf5", "ja": "そして、オーディション当日……", "zh": "然后，在甄选当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_2013_044miz", "source_sha256": "9a100af311e908bcb937e5829f8559bf2a2860a0667287ceaa62dee9fc6f5a40", "ja": "真壁瑞希です。特技はバトントワリング。\n趣味は手品で、好きなことはクロスワードパズルです。", "zh": "我叫做真壁瑞希。特技是舞棒，\n兴趣是变魔术，喜欢的活动是填字游戏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_2014_p", "source_sha256": "a4af15470fa36b564c31d0606dbe4a3badb6b531f78f8e2aa103f028f59b3f07", "ja": "君は……ありがとう。わざわざオーディションを\n受けに来てくれたんだね。ということは……。", "zh": "是你……谢谢你，竟然还特地跑来参加甄选。\n意思就是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_2015_044miz", "source_sha256": "38d6d28bd72b0871b8189f2fa662c2a3c58209f3f53196cf4bb3f13c5f9ffe19", "ja": "はい。気持ちが固まりました。\n……今、とてもドキドキしています。痛いくらい。", "zh": "是的，我下定决心了。\n……现在我感到心跳加速，快到发疼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_2016_044miz", "source_sha256": "933b00ad16f82c07331a87ea20c2cbce65b93d08f64c72f28b5a40c0f713edb0", "ja": "でも、不思議です。\nこの胸のドキドキは、嫌いじゃありません。", "zh": "不过，神奇的是，\n我并不讨厌这心跳加速的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_2017_044miz", "source_sha256": "c53b4a635561735b61abafe38d44bb075c1d21b2fcf5b97efa48453df2bc32c8", "ja": "うまく伝わっているか、わかりませんが。\n……素敵な予感がします。", "zh": "我不知道这样描述能不能让你理解。\n……我有很棒的预感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_2018_044miz", "source_sha256": "186b510f460ec3ad203ffc6d3769a878a9af9718be43c9b5a8c2a3b07bf7383e", "ja": "{$P$}。\nこのドキドキを、ワクワクに変えてくれますか？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n你能将我这紧张不安的心跳，变成兴奋期待的心跳吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_2019_p", "source_sha256": "4d20f2c916189a35db74477173d6c59577bae1feebe9effdc1221bb4a9376b80", "ja": "……もちろん。これからは39プロジェクトの\nアイドルとして、君をプロデュースさせて欲しい！", "zh": "……当然没问题。我希望你能成为\n39PROJECT偶像的一员，让我来培育你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_2020_044miz", "source_sha256": "b818ff2d5b7843beef97fa3fbc6307154f4776dcc7f6dab5e94bdc841d45e43f", "ja": "ありがとうございます。私、真壁瑞希は\nアイドル活動に、真剣に取り組みます。", "zh": "谢谢你。我，真壁瑞希，\n会认真专注在偶像活动上的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_2021_044miz", "source_sha256": "9f646090d366477332b0c4fe7ef841e06aca5070f25c20809d76642303878dbd", "ja": "頑張りますので、どうぞよろしくお願いします。\n……やってやるぞ。", "zh": "我会努力加油，还请多多指教了。\n……看我大显身手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_2022_p", "source_sha256": "d2853442b83418d327978acbd212d3946c6a738b58c988da9e9af28a7ed67988", "ja": "（言葉遣いは独特だし、一見無表情に見えるけど\n……いろんな想いを抱いている子なんだな）", "zh": "（她的用字遣词有些独特，而且乍看之下面无表情……\n但心里应该怀抱着许多想法吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_001_2023_p", "source_sha256": "f7c1ea8945e96d50bc62f55d0b99dd53fbaa955e5c7cefaa16b7d7dd75fd342a", "ja": "（彼女の可能性を広げるプロデュースを心がけよう。\nきっとファンは、片時も目を離せなくなるはずだ！）", "zh": "（我要用心培育她，拓展她的可能性。\n到时候粉丝肯定也会深深着迷！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
